```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as 调用方
    participant AIEl as AIElement
    participant AILoc as AIElementLocator
    participant LLM as LLM API
    participant Heal as HealEngine

    Caller->>AIEl: element("登录按钮", locator=(By.ID,"login"))

    rect rgb(20, 40, 60)
        Note over AIEl: 优先级1: 传统定位

        AIEl->>AIEl: 尝试 find_element(ID="login")
        alt 定位成功
            AIEl-->>Caller: 返回 WebElement
        else 定位失败
            AIEl->>AILoc: locate(html, "登录按钮", url)
            Note over AILoc: 优先级2: AI 语义定位

            rect rgb(30, 25, 55)
                Note over AILoc,LLM: AI 定位流程

                AILoc->>AILoc: 清洗 HTML
                AILoc->>LLM: ask(prompt)
                LLM-->>AILoc: {locator_type, value, confidence}

                alt confidence >= 0.85
                    AILoc->>AILoc: 缓存定位器
                    AILoc->>Heal: 更新 elements.yaml
                    Note over Heal: 自动采纳
                else confidence < 0.85
                    AILoc->>Heal: 记录 healing_log.jsonl
                    Note over Heal: 标记待人工审核
                end
            end

            AILoc-->>AIEl: LocatorResult
            AIEl->>AIEl: 使用新定位器重试

            alt 重试成功
                AIEl-->>Caller: 返回 WebElement
            else 重试失败
                AIEl-->>Caller: ElementNotFoundError
            end
        end
    end
```
